    "    verified    true only once a human or a fetch has confirmed the source",
    "                page actually states this. SEEDED CLAIMS ARE verified:false.",
    "",
    "  `rankings` is an array of { list, year, rank, source, verified }.",
    "",
    "POLICY, inherited verbatim from sf/src/data/golf-annotations.ts:",
    "  unknown fields stay absent, never guessed. A missing architect renders as",
    "  a gap in the dossier; a wrong one is a lie the map repeats forever.",
    "",
    "STATUS: the entries below were seeded from general knowledge on 2026-08-01",
    "and are ALL verified:false. They are here to exercise the schema and give",
    "the marquee courses a dossier. Run the verification pass before treating",
    "any of it as fact. `npm run validate` reports the unverified count.",
    "",
    "Note: OSM tags (holes, par, access, website, architect) are NOT curated here.",
    "They come through course-polygons.geojson and stay attributed to OSM."
